	(text "SSR DRIVE x2  high side, ground-referenced (rev B.4)"
		(at 22 26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "07ef728d-b823-4b77-abd0-4ee2d39a2c86")
	)
	(text "Each terminal's + is switched by a 60 V P-channel LP2309LT1G (Q5/Q6)\noff SSR_24V; the - pin is board GND, so an SSR lead chafed onto the\nearthed enclosure is a non-event, not a bypass. The GPIO drives an opto\nLED, never a gate: at 24 V a gate-to-drain failure would put 240 mA\ninto the pin. The opto pulls the gate down through 10k (R69/R70); the\n8.2 V zener (D13/D14) sets V_SG from the rail, not from CTR, and R7/R20\nhold the gate at the source against the opto's dark current. D9/D10\nfreewheel a contactor coil; LED3/LED4 read the terminal itself.\nNOT an isolation barrier - see DESIGN-NOTES.md (SSR block)."
		(at 22 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8a5dbe7e-66de-49e9-93a7-894271864c77")
	)
	(text "HARDWARE WATCHDOG"
		(at 147.32 26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f2f5968-4de9-4f23-b534-8ff118207762")
	)
	(text "U10 retriggerable one-shot: every rising edge on WDT_KICK restarts a\n~2.2 s window, so Q stays high only while firmware keeps kicking.\nQ holds Q3 on; Q3 pulls SSR_PG down, turning on high-side Q4, which\nsupplies SSR_EN (+5 V). SSR_EN enhances Q7, which pulls the gate of the\n24 V high-side switch Q9 down through R71 (D12 clamps V_SG to 8.2 V);\nQ9 feeds SSR_24V to both channels. Window expired: SSR_EN falls, R22\npulls Q9's gate to its source, SSR_24V is dead and both terminals are\noff whatever the channel switches are doing. R46/C38/C49 set the window.\nR48 holds B low when the MCU is high-Z. R47 is the fail-safe pull-up.\nSJ2 = bring-up defeat, REMOVE for service."
		(at 147.32 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f805181d-c7ab-472e-b583-6ac432f9917d")
	)
	(text "THERMOCOUPLE 1 (control)  MAX31856\nT- floats to J3, biased via BIAS"
		(at 297.59 29.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0db6d511-517d-52d8-8750-c53e7edeec15")
	)
	(text "THERMOCOUPLE 2 (load)  MAX31856\nT- floats to J8, biased via BIAS"
